DTSTAMP:20261014T044855Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261101
SUMMARY:Chandelure Super Mega Raid Day
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:Type: raid-day\n\nKan fås:\n• Chandelure (Mega) ✨ – mega
 -raid\n\nBonusser:\n• Daily Remote Raid Pass limit increased to 20\n• 
 Up to six free Raid Passes from spinning Gym Photo Discs\n• Chandelure c
 aught from Super Mega Raids start with Mega Level 1 unlocked\n• Increase
 d chance of Shiny Chandelure in Super Mega Raids\n• Up to 14 Raid Passes
  from spinning Gym Photo Discs\n• Increased chance to receive Rare Candy
  XL from Raid Battles\n• Additional 5\,000 XP from Super Mega Raid Battl
 es\n• Additional 5\,000 Stardust from Super Mega Raid Battles\n\nOctober
  31\, 2026\, 2:00–5:00 p.m. local time. Mega Chandelure makes its Pokém
 on GO debut in Super Mega Raids\; Chandelure caught from these raids alrea
 dy have Mega Level 1 unlocked. Mega Chandelure can reach Super Max Level a
 nd\, while Mega Evolved\, use the additional Charged Attack Ominous Wind+ 
 (50 power in Trainer Battles\, with a chance to raise Attack and Defense\;
  145 power in Gyms/Raids). Ominous Wind+ is an ongoing Mega Evolution mech
 anic\, not an event-exclusive move acquisition window. Free event Timed Re
 search awards a Premium Battle Pass and a Tyranitar encounter\; complete a
 nd claim it before it expires. A global raid-completion challenge runs Oct
 ober 30 at 5:00 p.m. PDT through October 31 at 8:00 p.m. PDT. Its separate
 \, conditional Mega Chandelure boosts run November 2–15 and are tracked 
 in another event. Optional US$4.99 ticket bonuses apply only from 2:00–5
 :00 p.m. local time October 31.\n\nKilder:\nhttps://pokemongo.com/news/sav
 e-the-date-s24\nhttps://pokemongo.com/news/chandelure-super-mega-raid-day-
 2026
CATEGORIES:raid-day
URL:https://pokemongo.com/news/save-the-date-s24
