DTSTAMP:20261014T044855Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261107
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261109
SUMMARY:PokéXciting! Singapore
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:Type: collaboration / timed-research\n\nKan fås:\n• Pikachu 
 (Blue) ✨ – stamp-rally-reward\, timed-research\n• Unown (S) ✨ – 
 incense\n• Unown (G) ✨ – incense\n• Venusaur (Gigantamax) ✨ – 
 max-battle\n• Charizard (Gigantamax) ✨ – max-battle\n• Blastoise (
 Gigantamax) ✨ – max-battle\n\nBonusser:\n• 2× pokestop-spin xp\n•
  50% less Stardust required for trades\n• 2 additional Special Trades\n
 • lure-duration\n• 2× XP for catching Pokémon with Nice Throws or be
 tter\n• Increased Candy for catching Pokémon with Nice Throws or better
 \n• 5 GO Snapshot surprise encounters per day\n• Bonus balloons appear
  once an hour during the event\n• Special in-game map effect\n\nPokéXci
 ting! Singapore runs November 7–8 from 10:00 a.m. to 10:00 p.m. local ti
 me\, with event gameplay available citywide. Changi Airport and Jewel host
  a dedicated five-stamp Regional GO Stamp Rally\, while the Cross-Region G
 O Stamp Rally stamp at Changi Airport Terminal 3 awards PokéXciting! Pika
 chu (Blue) with a local Location Background. Two free Timed Research track
 s\, event-themed Field Research\, boosted wild encounters\, Lure and Incen
 se encounters\, and Gigantamax Venusaur\, Charizard\, and Blastoise are av
 ailable during the event. The extended Blue Pikachu wild/stamp-rally avail
 ability after the weekend is tracked separately.\n\nKilder:\nhttps://pokem
 ongo.com/news/event-singapore-30th-anniversary-2026\nhttps://pokemongo.com
 /en/news/event-apac-30th-anniversary-2026
LOCATION:Singapore (citywide)
CATEGORIES:collaboration
URL:https://pokemongo.com/news/event-singapore-30th-anniversary-2026
END:VEVENT
