 amp-rally-reward\, wild\n\nPokéXciting! Pikachu (Blue) remains available 
 as a wild encounter in Singapore for one month after the November 7–8 ev
 ent concludes (through December 8). The separate five-stamp Regional GO St
 amp Rally at Changi Airport and Jewel lasts one month after the November 7
  event start (through approximately December 7\; exact cutoff time not spe
 cified)\, so its reward method has a narrower end date. The long-running C
 ross-Region rally and its Blue Pikachu Location Background reward are trac
 ked separately through September 11\, 2029.\n\nKilder:\nhttps://pokemongo.
 com/en/news/event-apac-30th-anniversary-2026\nhttps://sg.portal-pokemon.co
