DTSTAMP:20261014T044855Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261024
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261026
SUMMARY:Pokémon GO City Safari: Boston (Rescheduled)
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:Type: city-safari\nKræver billet\n\nKan fås:\n• Eevee (Expl
 orer Hat) ✨ – special-research\n• Flabébé (Orange Flower) – time
 d-research\, wild\n• Hawlucha – timed-research\, wild\n• Mudbray –
  timed-research\, wild\n• Komala – timed-research\, wild\n• Flamigo 
 – wild\n• Unown (B) ✨ – wild\n• Unown (L) ✨ – wild\n• Unow
 n (M) ✨ – wild\n• Unown (R) ✨ – wild\n\nBonusser:\n• Increased
  chance of encountering Shiny Pokémon\n• lure-duration\n• Up to 5 Spe
 cial Trades per event day\n• 50% less Stardust required for trades\n• 
 Buddy Pokémon can find the City Safari–exclusive Tiny Compass souvenir\
 n• Party Play duration extended to eight hours\n\nRescheduled from Septe
 mber 26–27 after severe weather. The replacement event runs globally fro
 m 10:00 a.m. to 6:00 p.m. local time on October 24 and 25\, exclusively fo
 r current ticket holders\; no additional tickets will be sold. The origina
 l wild encounters and event bonuses apply globally. The original Eevee-foc
 used Special Research is replaced by Timed Research featuring Flabébé (O
 range Flower)\, Hawlucha\, Mudbray\, and Komala\, plus branching weekend b
 onuses. There is no Boston GO Stamp Rally. Qualifying ticket holders can l
 og in from October 24\, 2026 through October 23\, 2028 to obtain supplemen
 tary Special Research for Boston Location Background Eevee encounters\, wh
 ich is an extended research-acquisition window for previously eligible tic
 ket holders\, not merely a completion grace period. No additional tickets 
 are being sold\; the calendar bar covers the October 24–25 rescheduled e
 vent gameplay.\n\nKilder:\nhttps://pokemongo.com/news/city-safari-boston-r
 escheduled\nhttps://pokemongo.com/en/news/boston-city-safari-know-before-y
 ou-go
CATEGORIES:city-safari
URL:https://pokemongo.com/news/city-safari-boston-rescheduled
END:VEVENT
